{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31160","headline":"陈州刺史寄鹤 · 薛能","name":"陈州刺史寄鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"临风高视耸奇形，渡海冲天想尽经。\n因得羽仪来合浦，便无魂梦去华亭。\n春飞见境乘桴切，夜唳闻时醉枕醒。\n南守欲知多少重，抚毛千万唤丁丁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}